9.3 MODULES

Recommended standard modules:

- adf_core – factory, IRs, linked services
- adf_assets – pipelines, datasets, triggers
- adf_connectivity – VNet, self‑hosted IR setup

9.4 SECRET RULE

If any linked service, dataset, or activity uses a secret:

- The secret must be stored in Azure Key Vault
- Terraform must reference it via azurerm_key_vault_secret and use the key_vault_secret_id attribute
- The secret value must not appear in the Terraform state in plain text (use sensitive = true)

